VPC 

AWS VPC Architecture Setup (Step-by-Step)

This setup creates:

VPC
Public Subnet
Private Subnet
Internet Gateway (IGW)
Public Route Table
Private Route Table
NAT Gateway
NACL
Web Server Security Group
App Server Security Group


